1
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,240
Just leave it at the door. Thank you.

2
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:38,240
It'll go bad if I leave it at the door.

3
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,479
Dad.

4
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:43,479
Hurry.

5
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:44,940
They're all fresh.

6
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,280
Why are you here?

7
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,479
Change your shoes.

8
00:01:48,479 --> 00:01:50,560
You haven't visited me for days.

9
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,200
I thought I'd come see you.

10
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:54,000
What do you mean?

11
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,080
I was just there the day before yesterday.

12
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:55,560
We even put things

13
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,160
in the fridge together.

14
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,440
What? Am I not welcome here?

15
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,440
What are you talking about?

16
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:05,120
Of course you're welcome.

17
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,660
I asked you to come before,

18
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:07,720
but you wouldn't.

19
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,320
I mean, if you want to come,

20
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:10,120
just give me a call,

21
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,250
and I'll pick you up.

22
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:12,440
No need.

23
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,130
You've tidied up this room quite well.

24
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,200
It's just a bit empty.

25
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:19,400
How about I write some calligraphy for you?

26
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,160
Look, hang it there, or there.

27
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,690
It would be perfect.

28
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,600
Sure, Dad.

29
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:27,480
But I'll hang it in my office later.

30
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,480
Hang it in the office?

31
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,560
Okay, the office is fine too.

32
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,480
I wrote the one in Xiaolong's office.

33
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:33,920
Right.

34
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:35,240
The 'Sword of Justice'.

35
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,170
She hung it in a very obvious place.

36
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,200
How's your health recently?

37
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,280
I mean...

38
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:45,640
Have you been going to rehab lately?

39
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,680
I used to go all the time.

40
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:49,000
I've been too busy these past couple of days.

41
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,120
I'll go again after I finish this case.

42
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,360
What case are you busy with?

43
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,560
It's still the same case as before.

44
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,360
The one with Xiaolong, Wangang.

45
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,540
Speaking of Xiaolong,

46
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,280
I have to say a few more words.

47
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,640
You need to get along well with her.

48
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,520
Don't always make her mad.

49
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,400
That really hurts the relationship.

50
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,120
I didn't make her mad. We...

51
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,280
Okay, I understand.

52
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:11,840
And also,

53
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,700
I'm just saying, you're a lawyer.

54
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,720
The scale in your heart

55
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,540
must be kept balanced.

56
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:22,130
If there's really a problem with Wangang,

57
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,640
you absolutely must not cover it up.

58
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,079
Dad, I need to take a call.

59
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,530
Please sit for a moment.

60
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,160
Hello, Lanya.

61
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:40,760
You and Su Bowen look at this.

62
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:45,600
Sure.

63
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,640
Are you leaving?

64
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:56,520
I'm going back.

65
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,200
Why are you going back?

66
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:58,520
Let's have a meal together.

67
00:03:58,520 --> 00:03:59,720
No, you're busy.

68
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,800
By the way, you always stay up late.

69
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,720
I brought you some liver protection tablets

70
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,560
and Vitamin C.

71
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,220
Remember to take them.

72
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:08,520
Okay, I'm leaving.

73
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,680
No, wait.

74
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,840
Don't rush. I'll get my car keys.

75
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:11,440
I'll drive you back. Don't...

76
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:14,040
You don't need to drive me. I'll just walk back.

77
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,280
Longfor Intelligent Living

78
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,760
Develop a resort?

79
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:51,520
Yes.

80
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,840
Wangang said

81
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:55,080
our place has beautiful scenery,

82
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,280
and they plan to focus on developing it.

83
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,840
Five-star hotels,

84
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,360
boutique B&Bs, and ecological scenic spots

85
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,560
will all be included.

86
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,160
Director Ma,

87
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,160
I just said we need to test the groundwater,

88
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,480
and they offered to develop a resort.

89
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,720
Don't you think it's fishy?

90
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:14,120
It seems like a windfall,

91
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:16,440
but it's very likely a trap.

92
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:19,000
We must hurry up and test the groundwater.

93
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,530
That won't do, Lawyer Xiao.

94
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:21,760
Wangang said

95
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,880
if problems are found in our land,

96
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,280
they won't want it.

97
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:27,440
Who will bear the loss then?

98
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:31,210
What about the sick villagers?

99
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,720
Besides,

100
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,360
a big company like Wangang,

101
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,290
wouldn't they test the land before acquiring it?

102
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:40,520
If they still acquire it even if the groundwater has problems,

103
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,960
doesn't it show they have something to hide?

104
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:43,720
Lawyer Xiao,

105
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:46,800
this development opportunity is really rare.

106
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,760
If this resort is built,

107
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,800
we'll have money

108
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,280
to treat the sick villagers,

109
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,040
right?

110
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,680
Director Ma said it well.

111
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:02,480
Caring about the villagers' welfare and the big picture.

112
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,240
Impressive.

113
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,240
Sit down, please.

114
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,880
Well, Lawyer Xiao.

115
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:09,240
I know you just want to test the groundwater.

116
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,720
I've already done it for you.

117
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,400
Here is the test report.

118
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,500
It didn't cost much. You're welcome.

119
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,760
Everyone, the report is out.

120
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:20,600
All indicators in our village are normal.

121
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,480
Rest assured.

122
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,960
How can we rest assured?

123
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:27,040
A test report from such a small company,

124
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,400
we don't even know if they are qualified.

125
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,520
How can we trust it?

126
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,040
Only a report from an official authoritative institution

127
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,400
is valid.

128
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,400
Believe it or not.

129
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,880
No, Lawyer Xiao.

130
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,650
Who do you think you are?

131
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,840
This is Fuyuan Village's own business.

132
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,640
Why are you always interfering?

133
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,130
Can't you stand seeing others do well?

134
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:45,530
Or maybe you're doing this on purpose,

135
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:49,060
deliberately questioning Lawyer Li's development plan.

136
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,970
What do you mean?

137
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,040
The plan is Lawyer Li's.

138
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,780
You came up with this plan.

139
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,520
Mr. Wan.

140
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,400
I do have a solution.

141
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,800
Develop Fuyuan Village.

142
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,240
Turn it into a resort.

143
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,440
Take the initiative into our own hands.

144
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,690
Director Ma, what should we do?

145
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,720
Tell me, what does this mean?

146
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,850
Is this the result of your consideration?

147
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:42,880
Li Xin.

148
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:45,520
Do you know that what you are doing now

149
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:48,050
is beyond the professional scope of a lawyer?

150
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,320
You are covering up a crime for someone.

151
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:53,360
How many perfectly healthy people are left in this village?

152
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,720
And those who have passed away.

153
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,800
Those were living human lives.

154
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,810
I can't explain it to you right now.

155
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:02,920
I always thought

156
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:05,840
that we

157
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:09,780
just had different understandings of justice,

158
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:12,140
but we still had our bottom lines.

159
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:15,140
I thought we were just rivals.

160
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,040
I didn't expect us to be enemies.

161
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,480
You really disappointed me.

162
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,380
What are you doing?

163
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:50,520
Well, my stomach hurts.

164
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,920
I need to relieve myself.

165
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,240
Are you with that female lawyer?

166
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:56,120
What female lawyer?

167
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,120
I don't know her.

168
00:08:57,280 --> 00:09:00,560
I'm a wilderness exploration blogger.

169
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,920
I'm surviving in the wild here.

170
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:02,960
Go back to your business.

171
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,800
I have to go explore.

172
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,480
Hello, Director Ma.

173
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,360
Mr. Wan.

174
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:30,120
We previously agreed on 300,000 per household.

175
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:32,120
Could you offer a bit more?

176
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,800
What? Are you raising the price on me?

177
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:35,920
No, no, no.

178
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,920
Mr. Wan, how would I dare?

179
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,680
It's all because of that female lawyer.

180
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,800
She's stirring things up in the village,

181
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:43,480
saying Wangang's resort development

182
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,040
is driven by a guilty conscience.

183
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,440
They're using this trick

184
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,480
just to prevent us from testing.

185
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,000
Let's think about it.

186
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,400
Are our lives and health

187
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,040
only worth 300,000?

188
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:56,080
What about our deceased relatives,

189
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:58,080
and our future children,

190
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,320
and their children?

191
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,650
What about their lives?

192
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,280
What about their health?

193
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,730
How much are they worth?

194
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:06,400
If we can confirm that Wangang

195
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:09,560
If they need to take responsibility for this pollution,

196
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,520
the compensation they end up paying

197
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:13,650
will likely be much more than 300,000.

198
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,600
Really?

199
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:20,000
With her doing this, people are unsettled.

200
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,560
They say they won't sign unless more money is added.

201
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:23,280
Lately,

202
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:26,880
villagers have been coming to make trouble for me every few days.

203
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:27,920
Mr. Wan.

204
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:28,800
Mr. Wan.

205
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:32,840
Brother.

206
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:33,440
Come here.

207
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,620
Listen carefully.

208
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,610
Understood.

209
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,160
Stop hiding. Come out.

210
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:21,600
Tell me.

211
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:24,220
Isn't this too much of a coincidence?

212
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:27,160
I was wondering why there was always a dark shadow

213
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:29,160
following me in and out lately.

214
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,480
So you were stalking me.

215
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:33,800
What do you mean stalking? That sounds awful.

216
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,840
I... I was just...

217
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,720
I...

218
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,520
Protecting me in secret.

219
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,720
Like a Dark Knight.

220
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,120
Brother Hu,

221
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:58,760
I...

222
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,850
know what you're usually like,

223
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,280
right?

224
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,000
But in your heart,

225
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,530
there must still be a little flame of justice.

226
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,720
I just hope that

227
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,360
no matter when,

228
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:17,880
no matter how well-dressed you are,

229
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:21,720
this little flame never goes out.

230
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:23,880
Right. I know.

231
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,120
I...

232
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,400
I'm going home. Are you following?

233
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,720
Following what? Just go.

234
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,480
Ride safely.

235
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,440
What happened?

236
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,420
The doctor said it's a concussion

237
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,160
and a hairline fracture in her arm.

238
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:57,400
It's not life-threatening, but she needs to rest.

239
00:13:57,400 --> 00:13:57,720
No.

240
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,930
The doctor won't let you in.

241
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,680
What exactly happened with this car accident?

242
00:14:01,680 --> 00:14:04,520
The traffic police said the other party crashed into her,

243
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,920
and then ran away.

244
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:07,480
It seemed intentional.

245
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:10,440
Blame me. It's actually my fault.

246
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:12,160
I should have taken her back.

247
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,820
If I were with her, this wouldn't have happened.

248
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,720
Impossible.

249
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:16,680
What do you mean?

250
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,460
Where is Xiaolong?

251
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:20,580
Godfather.

252
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,760
Where? Here?

253
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:23,600
Uncle Xiao,

254
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,440
you can't go in. The patient needs to rest.

255
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,440
Calm down.

256
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,240
No, I want to see my daughter.

257
00:14:28,240 --> 00:14:29,320
Please go out first.

258
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,240
Xiaolong is fine.

259
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,370
Okay, okay, I'll go.

260
00:14:31,440 --> 00:14:33,880
Let her rest.

261
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,160
Godfather, calm down.

262
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:36,920
Who hit her?

263
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,640
Who hit her? Where is the person?

264
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,440
They ran away.

265
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,440
How did they run away?

266
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,600
Godfather, I understand how you feel right now,

267
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:44,600
but Xiaolong needs you the most now.

268
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:46,280
Let's wait for her to wake up.

269
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:49,320
Then the doctor,

270
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,650
what did the doctor say?

271
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,760
It's okay.

272
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:54,210
It's not life-threatening. Don't worry.

273
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,120
Did you know it all along?

274
00:15:14,920 --> 00:15:17,320
I didn't want to believe it before.

275
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,330
But after the law firm was smashed,

276
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,010
she went to see Dali.

277
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,570
You stay here

278
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:33,170
and take good care of Xiaolong.

279
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,770
Where are you going?

280
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,200
Keep an eye on Uncle Xiao.

281
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:49,890
Boss, it's done.

282
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,480
After hitting that female lawyer,

283
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,440
he's already hidden away.

284
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,720
The money has been delivered.

285
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,120
We'll arrange for him to go abroad tonight.

286
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,440
Well done.

287
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,240
Who is it?

288
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:07,840
Go out first.

289
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:18,650
Why are you so angry, Lawyer Li?

290
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:19,920
What happened?

291
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,000
Wan Zhuoli,

292
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,640
or is your surname still Sun?

293
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:29,840
If you keep acting up and cause trouble,

294
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:33,370
do you think your father will give up everything to protect you?

295
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:35,840
You're just your father's pawn.

296
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:37,000
Being a pawn is good.

297
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:39,160
I like being a pawn.

298
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:42,480
I have food, drinks, and fun. It's great.

299
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:45,000
Then be a good pawn.

300
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,600
Save your own skin.

301
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:50,520
Don't mess around until your father doesn't want you again.

302
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:52,320
In the end, you'll have nothing,

303
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:55,280
turning from a pawn back into a discarded piece.

304
00:16:57,680 --> 00:17:01,360
You bastard!

305
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,040
Come on.

306
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:04,560
Come on.

307
00:17:07,079 --> 00:17:07,940
You don't dare.

308
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:12,050
I know everything you've done before.

309
00:17:12,079 --> 00:17:13,599
If you dare to touch Xiao Longnv again,

310
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:14,839
I promise to make your life

311
00:17:14,839 --> 00:17:16,480
less comfortable than it is now.

312
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,210
Understand?

313
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,400
I'm back.

314
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:44,250
Where is Uncle Xiao?

315
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:47,600
He was just here.

316
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:48,600
We chatted for a bit.

317
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,600
Then he asked me to fetch some water.

318
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:57,680
He hung up on me.

319
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:00,560
Dong Beihu, what can you even do?

320
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,240
Where is your boss, the one named Wan?

321
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,480
I'm not sure.

322
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:15,170
Where is your boss, Mr. Wan?

323
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:15,970
I don't know.

324
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,000
It's fine.

325
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:37,900
Did you order someone to hit my daughter?

326
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:40,640
I don't know.

327
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:42,840
Who is your daughter?

328
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:43,600
Xiao Longnü.

329
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:45,680
Lawyer Xiao?

330
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,520
Is she dead?

331
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,100
What are you doing?

332
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:07,160
I'll kill you!

333
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:14,160
Jun!

334
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:14,640
What are you doing?

335
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:15,680
Let go of him!

336
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:16,800
Let go!

337
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:18,760
Jun, calm down.

338
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:19,360
Calm down.

339
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,120
Let's talk when Hu gets back.

340
00:19:21,200 --> 00:19:23,880
Why can't Xiao Longnü win the lawsuit?

341
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,680
Her father is a big thug.

342
00:19:26,520 --> 00:19:27,280
Let's go.

343
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,400
Son of a bitch.

344
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:49,960
Are you okay?

345
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,240
I'm fine.

346
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:52,770
Take a few steps.

347
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:05,520
Bear with it.

348
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:06,920
Bro, please don't.

349
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:08,220
Don't move.

350
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,160
Bro, please don't.

351
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,000
Don't move.

352
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:13,280
Bro, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

353
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:17,120
Stop looking. Stop looking.

354
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:19,180
Everyone, turn around. Turn around.

355
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:20,520
It'll be quick.

356
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:21,520
Please don't.

357
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:27,720
Good boy. Well done.

358
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:32,200
Good job.

359
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:44,930
Call the police.

360
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:47,800
Someone got beaten up at Yuqiongge Bathhouse.

361
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:08,400
Slow down.

362
00:21:09,600 --> 00:21:10,730
This is outrageous.

363
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:14,280
You're too ruthless.

364
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:16,880
Officer, look. Look at how badly he was beaten.

365
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:18,620
The attack was too brutal.

366
00:21:35,600 --> 00:21:37,280
Long, you're awake.

367
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:39,610
Are you feeling any better?

368
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:41,160
I feel a bit dizzy.

369
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:43,240
It's okay. Take your time.

370
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:45,160
Don't think about anything.

371
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:55,720
Xin, I'm at the hospital.

372
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,040
What?

373
00:22:09,320 --> 00:22:10,120
I understand.

374
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:15,520
Mr. Li.

375
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:18,080
What's wrong?

376
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:02,560
You scared me.

377
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:04,700
What are you doing?

378
00:23:05,120 --> 00:23:07,440
I heard you rushing upstairs just now.

379
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:10,440
Nothing. The mattress over there is too soft.

380
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:11,600
It makes my back ache.

381
00:23:11,600 --> 00:23:13,130
So I came back for the night.

382
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:19,200
You're still thinking about the law firm, aren't you?

383
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:24,680
Lawyer Xiao has suffered a lot.

384
00:23:25,280 --> 00:23:28,160
With so many things going on, it breaks my heart.

385
00:23:29,080 --> 00:23:30,920
I want to cover her rent for these few months.

386
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:31,920
Waive it for her.

387
00:23:32,120 --> 00:23:34,850
We should help as much as we can. What do you think?

388
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:37,120
Sure, whatever you say.

389
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:42,400
How are things

390
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:45,360
between you and Dali lately?

391
00:23:45,880 --> 00:23:49,600
Pretty good. He's just busy with company stuff.

392
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,280
Speaking of your childhood friend,

393
00:23:58,280 --> 00:24:00,160
he's really been great to you.

394
00:24:00,360 --> 00:24:02,200
He found you a good job

395
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:04,410
and helped take care of our family.

396
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:07,280
When will we ever be able to repay such a huge favor?

397
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:08,960
Why are you bringing this up?

398
00:24:11,600 --> 00:24:15,280
You know, when we didn't have money before,

399
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:19,560
I used to think about how to make big money every day.

400
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:23,240
Now that we suddenly have money,

401
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:25,600
I actually feel uneasy.

402
00:24:26,520 --> 00:24:28,680
I worry every day.

403
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:30,620
Making money is so easy

404
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,040
and smooth.

405
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:34,760
Can I spend this money with peace of mind?

406
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:38,480
Huzi.

407
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:41,280
I never expected

408
00:24:41,280 --> 00:24:43,400
you to make a fortune.

409
00:24:44,080 --> 00:24:46,400
As long as you are safe,

410
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,640
happy,

411
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:49,400
and live an honest life,

412
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:51,360
I'll be satisfied.

413
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:53,360
I know.

414
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:57,140
Are you hungry?

415
00:24:58,120 --> 00:24:58,880
I'm hungry.

416
00:24:59,360 --> 00:25:01,020
I'll cook some noodles for us.

417
00:25:01,520 --> 00:25:02,320
Wait a moment.

418
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:26,440
Dad.

419
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:29,090
What are you doing? Are you healed?

420
00:25:29,160 --> 00:25:30,200
Why are you here?

421
00:25:34,760 --> 00:25:36,760
I'm representing your case now.

422
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,480
You don't need to worry about me.

423
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:39,160
I caused the trouble.

424
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:41,160
Let the court decide.

425
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,920
It's just like going back for re-education.

426
00:25:42,920 --> 00:25:44,320
I'll be back in a few days.

427
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:47,280
Dad, the current situation is

428
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:51,480
that you might be sentenced to five years

429
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:52,240
or more.

430
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:56,920
The injury report shows a level six disability.

431
00:25:57,800 --> 00:26:00,040
His leg is broken.

432
00:26:01,600 --> 00:26:02,360
Impossible.

433
00:26:02,600 --> 00:26:05,240
Do you remember what happened then?

434
00:26:05,360 --> 00:26:06,280
Because that day,

435
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:06,880
I was angry.

436
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:07,760
After I visited you at the hospital,

437
00:26:07,760 --> 00:26:08,600
I went in.

438
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:10,280
Then his lackeys next to him

439
00:26:10,280 --> 00:26:11,560
rushed over with sticks.

440
00:26:11,560 --> 00:26:13,440
I grabbed one and swung it.

441
00:26:13,840 --> 00:26:15,800
But I didn't hit him that hard.

442
00:26:17,520 --> 00:26:18,040
Long.

443
00:26:19,600 --> 00:26:20,800
I'm sorry.

444
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:21,800
It's all my fault.

445
00:26:22,600 --> 00:26:24,860
If I hadn't insisted on taking this case,

446
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:26,600
things wouldn't have turned out like this.

447
00:26:26,600 --> 00:26:27,440
No, Longlong,

448
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,840
you can't say that.

449
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:30,960
You took the case to help others.

450
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:33,600
I hit him because I was angry.

451
00:26:33,600 --> 00:26:34,320
I just...

452
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,800
I shouldn't have caused you trouble

453
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:41,960
at such a critical time, sweetie.

454
00:26:42,120 --> 00:26:42,720
Really,

455
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:43,960
I'm really sorry.

456
00:26:43,960 --> 00:26:45,680
Dad, don't say that.

457
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:48,200
You have nothing to be sorry for.

458
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:02,840
Long.

459
00:27:03,640 --> 00:27:04,240
Long.

460
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:06,680
Jun didn't suffer too much in there, did he?

461
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:07,120
Right.

462
00:27:07,120 --> 00:27:08,200
Xiaolong, let me know if you need money.

463
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:09,560
I can sell the restaurant right away.

464
00:27:09,560 --> 00:27:10,360
I have some here too.

465
00:27:10,360 --> 00:27:11,560
It's fine, Uncle.

466
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,560
Don't worry too much about it.

467
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:17,100
He is my dad, after all.

468
00:27:17,360 --> 00:27:18,680
I'll figure something out.

469
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,360
Long, if you need any help...

470
00:27:20,360 --> 00:27:21,000
Uncle.

471
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:22,660
I need some time alone.

472
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,280
Xin,

473
00:27:33,280 --> 00:27:34,480
tell me the truth.

474
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:37,240
Xiaolong's family is facing such a big crisis.

475
00:27:37,240 --> 00:27:38,500
Is it directly related

476
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:41,080
to Wan Gang?

477
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:45,280
You and Xiaolong

478
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:48,280
have been friends for so many years.

479
00:27:48,480 --> 00:27:50,720
Don't you want to lend a helping hand

480
00:27:51,320 --> 00:27:52,760
at a critical moment?

481
00:27:56,280 --> 00:27:59,920
You won't continue to work for Wan Gang, will you?

482
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:04,480
There are so many people in your law firm.

483
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:07,160
Why do you have to be the one to do this?

484
00:28:11,360 --> 00:28:12,240
Well,

485
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,600
it really has to be me.

486
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:21,520
Okay.

487
00:28:22,040 --> 00:28:23,680
Let's not argue about this.

488
00:28:25,920 --> 00:28:27,000
I know

489
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,800
I've said a lot of things

490
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:31,160
that you're tired of hearing.

491
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,360
Don't worry.

492
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:34,120
I won't

493
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:37,520
nag you for the rest of your life.

494
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,200
Dad just hopes

495
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:43,800
that you won't regret the things you say

496
00:28:44,240 --> 00:28:45,370
and do in the future.

497
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:53,200
I believe my son,

498
00:28:53,560 --> 00:28:54,480
deep down,

499
00:28:56,080 --> 00:28:57,680
still has a sense of justice.

500
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:00,760
Right, Xiaolong?

501
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:04,120
Xiaoxin.

502
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:05,840
Right, son?

503
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:27,080
Morning.

504
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:28,400
Morning, Director.

505
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,660
Morning, Sister Long.

506
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:30,320
Director,

507
00:29:30,760 --> 00:29:32,280
here are some precedents

508
00:29:32,760 --> 00:29:34,480
of similar assault cases I found.

509
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:37,210
I've also highlighted some defense strategies.

510
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:38,970
See if they can help Uncle Xiao.

511
00:29:39,560 --> 00:29:41,290
What happened to your glasses?

512
00:29:41,560 --> 00:29:45,200
I broke them in my sleep last night.

513
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,160
Sleeping?

514
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,400
Sister Long, well,

515
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,840
besides taking your own medicine,

516
00:29:48,840 --> 00:29:50,400
you should also take these Panax notoginseng tablets

517
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:51,520
and Vitamin D.

518
00:29:51,520 --> 00:29:53,840
Taking them together will help you recover faster.

519
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:56,040
Just remember to take them after meals.

520
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:57,680
Don't move.

521
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:07,260
What happened?

522
00:30:08,080 --> 00:30:09,440
I fell off my bike

523
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:11,280
after work last night.

524
00:30:11,320 --> 00:30:13,160
You can fall like this from a bike?

525
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:14,800
There was a small pebble on the road.

526
00:30:14,800 --> 00:30:16,120
I got stuck on it

527
00:30:16,120 --> 00:30:17,280
and just fell right there.

528
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:19,280
I... She insisted on giving me a ride.

529
00:30:19,280 --> 00:30:21,560
Yeah, he insisted on riding the bike I was on.

530
00:30:21,560 --> 00:30:21,880
No.

531
00:30:21,880 --> 00:30:23,410
Don't you live downstairs?

532
00:30:24,720 --> 00:30:27,560
We went to the corner to eat Malatang.

533
00:30:27,680 --> 00:30:30,480
How can you be so... Stop making things up, you two.

534
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:33,440
I've dragged you down.

535
00:30:34,920 --> 00:30:36,840
What are you talking about, Director?

536
00:30:36,840 --> 00:30:37,920
We are a team.

537
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:39,440
There's no such thing as dragging anyone down.

538
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,320
Exactly.

539
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,080
How about this?

540
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:51,520
Lately,

541
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:54,440
everyone has been working hard.

542
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:57,060
I'll give you some paid annual leave.

543
00:30:57,280 --> 00:30:58,720
Get some good rest

544
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:00,200
and spend time with your families.

545
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:03,000
No need. I'm not going back.

546
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,920
Why take annual leave? I'm not tired.

547
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:05,760
Gu Miaomiao,

548
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:07,680
listen to me on this.

549
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,500
I'm really not afraid.

550
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:11,060
I'm not afraid either.

551
00:31:11,280 --> 00:31:13,720
In situations like this, we should stick together even more.

552
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:15,380
There's strength in numbers.

553
00:31:15,800 --> 00:31:17,280
What strength?

554
00:31:18,440 --> 00:31:20,240
What strength do the three of us have?

555
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:22,320
Today, your glasses broke.

556
00:31:22,320 --> 00:31:23,280
You got scraped.

557
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:24,480
What about tomorrow?

558
00:31:24,680 --> 00:31:26,210
You're not afraid, but I am.

559
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,920
My reach isn't that long.

560
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:30,000
I can't protect that many people.

561
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:32,760
If he dares to do it again, we'll call the police and have him arrested.

562
00:31:32,760 --> 00:31:34,320
Call the police, and then what?

563
00:31:34,320 --> 00:31:35,800
A bunch of them got arrested today.

564
00:31:35,800 --> 00:31:37,080
They'll be released in a few months.

565
00:31:37,080 --> 00:31:38,320
They come one after another.

566
00:31:38,320 --> 00:31:39,680
Can we withstand them?

567
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:42,400
Are... Are you still going to take the bar exam?

568
00:31:43,080 --> 00:31:43,800
And you,

569
00:31:44,120 --> 00:31:45,000
you're a girl.

570
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:46,600
If something happens to you,

571
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:49,400
how can I explain it to your parents?

572
00:31:50,080 --> 00:31:50,760
I...

573
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:53,080
Don't give me this crying act.

574
00:31:53,080 --> 00:31:54,010
I hate seeing it.

575
00:31:55,040 --> 00:31:56,100
Hurry up and leave.

576
00:31:58,280 --> 00:32:00,280
We agreed

577
00:32:00,280 --> 00:32:03,080
to make the law firm bigger and stronger together.

578
00:32:09,760 --> 00:32:11,240
I'm just incompetent.

579
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:13,600
Alright?

580
00:32:16,520 --> 00:32:17,680
I'm begging you.

581
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:20,040
Just go.

582
00:32:30,040 --> 00:32:32,480
She didn't mean that.

583
00:32:32,880 --> 00:32:33,520
Let's go.

584
00:32:51,160 --> 00:32:51,760
Brother.

585
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,820
Mr. Wan, why did you ask me to come?

586
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:57,760
Why do you look so haggard?

587
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:59,600
Haven't you been sleeping well lately?

588
00:32:59,600 --> 00:33:00,560
Is that all?

589
00:33:04,280 --> 00:33:05,680
I want you to take the case

590
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:09,960
of my brother who was injured by Xiao Jun.

591
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:17,920
I think you have a good relationship with Xiao Longnv,

592
00:33:18,120 --> 00:33:20,320
and you are our family's legal advisor.

593
00:33:20,520 --> 00:33:23,680
After thinking about it, I don't trust anyone else.

594
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,850
You are the best fit.

595
00:33:44,320 --> 00:33:46,050
Where are Luo Zhi and Miaomiao?

596
00:33:46,080 --> 00:33:47,810
I gave them their annual leave.

597
00:33:54,200 --> 00:33:55,400
How is your recovery?

598
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:57,800
I just went to Cheng Fei's place.

599
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:02,200
I wrote down all the precautions

600
00:34:02,200 --> 00:34:04,000
and dietary restrictions for you.

601
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:06,360
I'll go with you to his place again tomorrow

602
00:34:06,360 --> 00:34:08,090
so we can do a thorough checkup.

603
00:34:09,280 --> 00:34:11,440
No need. I'm fine.

604
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,560
Just tell me what's on your mind.

605
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:28,360
I met with Wan Zhuoli.

606
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:32,800
What? Are you feeling torn

607
00:34:33,679 --> 00:34:35,600
because Xiao Jun is

608
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:37,100
Xiao Longnv's father?

609
00:34:38,080 --> 00:34:39,739
He said for Uncle Xiao's case,

610
00:34:40,199 --> 00:34:43,260
I can have my subordinate issue a letter of forgiveness

611
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:45,679
and waive the financial compensation,

612
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:49,280
but there's a condition.

613
00:34:50,199 --> 00:34:53,080
As long as Xiao Longnv stops bothering Wan Gang,

614
00:34:53,080 --> 00:34:56,340
as for the lawsuit between the farmers and Fuyuan Village,

615
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:58,380
he hopes you can drop the case.

616
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:08,600
Got it.

617
00:35:09,920 --> 00:35:11,160
I'll think about it.

618
00:35:18,520 --> 00:35:19,240
Xiaolong.

619
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:22,850
This will definitely be resolved.

620
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:24,480
Sure.

621
00:35:24,560 --> 00:35:26,400
But we need to sign

622
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:27,930
a formal agency agreement.

623
00:35:28,200 --> 00:35:29,760
Alright, let's sign it.

624
00:35:30,960 --> 00:35:31,880
Trust me.

625
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:59,440
Is Brother Jun's situation really that serious?

626
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:01,800
The injured person is your childhood friend's man.

627
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:03,730
Shouldn't you know better than me?

628
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:05,680
I'll go back and beg Dali right now.

629
00:36:05,680 --> 00:36:06,720
I'll beg him to let Brother Jun go.

630
00:36:06,720 --> 00:36:07,980
Is it useful to beg him?

631
00:36:08,520 --> 00:36:09,780
It will only backfire.

632
00:36:11,640 --> 00:36:12,900
Then what should we do?

633
00:36:18,240 --> 00:36:19,920
I thought you had a lot of ideas.

634
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:21,240
Are you just posing?

635
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:31,220
You finally decided to come back.

636
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:38,040
Because of a lawsuit,

637
00:36:38,160 --> 00:36:40,080
you've ruined their family.

638
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:42,320
What?

639
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:44,640
You want to beat me up too?

640
00:36:47,040 --> 00:36:48,200
I wanted to.

641
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:56,320
Honest enough.

642
00:36:59,040 --> 00:37:01,120
Seems you still treat me as a brother.

643
00:37:02,240 --> 00:37:02,920
Dali.

644
00:37:04,560 --> 00:37:05,820
Since we are brothers,

645
00:37:07,440 --> 00:37:08,480
I beg you.

646
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:11,890
Let Brother Jun off the hook, okay?

647
00:37:12,240 --> 00:37:13,370
That's impossible.

648
00:37:15,120 --> 00:37:16,320
You are my brother.

649
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:19,320
And the one who got beaten is also my brother.

650
00:37:19,320 --> 00:37:20,400
If it were you,

651
00:37:21,040 --> 00:37:22,300
could I just ignore it?

652
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:37,480
All right, this is not up for discussion.

653
00:37:37,480 --> 00:37:38,480
Since you're back,

654
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:39,680
go out and take a look.

655
00:37:40,240 --> 00:37:42,360
This shop can't run without you.

656
00:38:00,160 --> 00:38:00,640
Dad Li.

657
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:01,970
You're back.

658
00:38:02,320 --> 00:38:02,850
Hurry up.

659
00:38:03,720 --> 00:38:05,050
Wipe your hands and eat.

660
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:07,880
You don't have to come over just to cook for me.

661
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:09,800
Why are you being so polite with me?

662
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:11,880
Just focus on recovering from your injuries.

663
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:14,280
If anything happens, Dad Li is here for you.

664
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:27,180
How is Xiaolong doing?

665
00:38:30,600 --> 00:38:32,440
He's recovering okay.

666
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:34,540
But he just doesn't have much energy.

667
00:38:34,600 --> 00:38:36,960
If Xiaolong hadn't left Honghu back then,

668
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:40,120
things wouldn't have turned out like this.

669
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:47,560
Attorney Xiao, are you feeling better?

670
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,520
I heard about what happened.

671
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:51,400
If it's too hard, let's drop the lawsuit.

672
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,920
I'll still pay your legal fees.

673
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,320
People...

674
00:38:55,520 --> 00:38:58,580
Sometimes they have to learn to make the right choices.

675
00:38:59,120 --> 00:39:02,680
I just want Honghu to establish a foothold in Leyang.

676
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:03,640
And you

677
00:39:05,080 --> 00:39:06,360
can make it go further.

678
00:39:12,160 --> 00:39:14,800
Congratulations to Xingang Chemical Energy Group Co., Ltd.

679
00:39:14,800 --> 00:39:16,330
on the successful signing.

680
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:29,960
Drawing high attention from the industry.

681
00:40:16,720 --> 00:40:18,080
Besides, whose daughter am I?

682
00:40:18,080 --> 00:40:19,480
Could Lao Xiao's daughter get into trouble?

683
00:40:19,480 --> 00:40:20,920
No, no matter how old you are,

684
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,560
you are Lao Xiao's child.

685
00:40:22,560 --> 00:40:25,620
Lao Xiao has a responsibility to protect you, you know?

686
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:57,200
Dad, good news.

687
00:41:57,200 --> 00:41:57,920
What is it?

688
00:41:58,600 --> 00:42:00,560
Our case has a turnaround.

689
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:04,040
They are willing to issue a letter of forgiveness.

690
00:42:04,040 --> 00:42:06,440
And we don't even have to pay the medical bills.

691
00:42:06,440 --> 00:42:07,640
How is that possible?

692
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:08,640
It's true.

693
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:11,410
Did they come to you?

694
00:42:13,640 --> 00:42:14,880
What's the catch?

695
00:42:15,200 --> 00:42:16,840
No, there's no catch.

696
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:18,720
Okay, don't lie to me.

697
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:20,600
I've been around the block for years.

698
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:21,880
You can't fool me with this kind of thing.

699
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:22,200
What's wrong?

700
00:42:22,200 --> 00:42:24,760
Did they tell you not to represent Old Pan?

701
00:42:26,040 --> 00:42:27,280
It's not them.

702
00:42:27,800 --> 00:42:29,200
I thought about it.

703
00:42:30,080 --> 00:42:32,320
The case isn't going

704
00:42:33,480 --> 00:42:34,610
smoothly right now.

705
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:37,280
Besides,

706
00:42:38,480 --> 00:42:40,680
we probably won't win the second trial.

707
00:42:40,920 --> 00:42:43,450
And the law firm's business is being delayed.

708
00:42:44,000 --> 00:42:45,040
So,

709
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:49,720
I just want to give up.

710
00:42:50,520 --> 00:42:52,680
If I give up,

711
00:42:53,640 --> 00:42:54,680
it'll be good for everyone.
